{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2021-08-27 09:00:00', 'title': 'TRUIST COMMITS $1 MILLION TO THE HENRY LOUIS AARON FUND TO SUPPORT HBCU STUDENTS AND ALUMNI', 'text': "ATLANTA, AUG. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TRUIST FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NYSE: TFC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE HOMERS FOR HANK PROGRAM, A FIVE-YEAR COMMITMENT TO DONATE $755 TO THE HENRY LOUIS AARON FUND FOR EVERY HOME RUN HIT BY THE ATLANTA BRAVES, TOTALING A MINIMUM OF $1 MILLION. THE FUNDS WILL BE USED TO BUILD A PROGRAM THAT PROVIDES SCHOLARSHIPS FOR STUDENTS ATTENDING HISTORICALLY BLACK COLLEGES AND UNIVERSITIES, CAREER DEVELOPMENT PROGRAMS FOR HBCU STUDENTS/ALUMNI AND OTHER FUTURE SUPPORT INITIATIVES IN HONOR OF HANK AARON'S LEGACY."}